cognized tax benefits observed during 2007 and 2008 was $143.9 million.\",\n    \"value\": 143.9,\n    \"unit\": \"millions of dollars\",\n    \"calculation\": \"Ending 2008 balance ($214.4 million) minus beginning 2007 balance ($70.5 million) = $143.9 million, equal to the 2007 increase ($56.1 million) plus the 2008 increase ($87.8 million).\",\n    \"sources\": [\n      \"source:t1c2n0\",\n      \"source:t8c2n0\",\n      \"source:t1c1n0\",\n      \"source:t8c1n0\"\n    ],\n    \"result_id\": \"tool:2\"\n  }\n}"},"reviewer_is_not_blinded":true,"task_key":"X3"}